{"amendments":[],"id":"heat-spreader-sizing-01-basis","requirements":[{"id":"HEAT01-GEOMETRY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Geometry and boundary definitions; Engineering objective and shop capability","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"rows:baseline_40,revision_60","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df212051c8ed02c328f"}],"text":"Each candidate is an unperforated 100 mm long, 2 mm thick rectangular plate with its declared 40 mm or 60 mm width, within the 65 mm width envelope."},{"id":"HEAT01-BOUNDARIES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Geometry and boundary definitions","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"heat_input_w,cold_face_temperature_c","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df212051c8ed02c328f"}],"text":"The numerical model fixes the complete X=0 face at 25 °C, applies total 4 W uniformly to the complete X=100 mm face, and insulates all four longitudinal faces."},{"id":"HEAT01-MATERIAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Geometry and boundary definitions","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"conductivity_w_mk,density_kg_m3","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df212051c8ed02c328f"}],"text":"The model uses constant thermal conductivity 200 W/(m·K); density 2700 kg/m³ is used only for comparative mass and is not presented as certified alloy data."},{"id":"HEAT01-FIELDS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/prompt.txt","locator":"requested numerical temperature fields","sha256":"f08a8caa5bc41b282b5386578be028bf60312da099b5613c600db9b73635e5d1"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Reporting policy","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"}],"text":"Both width candidates retain actual coarse and refined numerical temperature fields distinct from the analytical calculation and the input diagram."},{"id":"HEAT01-ANALYTICAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Geometry and boundary definitions; Reporting policy","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df212051c8ed02c328f"}],"text":"Each numerical hot-end temperature rise agrees within 2% of Q·L/(k·W·t) using that candidate's declared dimensions and inputs."},{"id":"HEAT01-BALANCE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Reporting policy","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"heat_input_w","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df212051c8ed02c328f"}],"text":"Each refined candidate field has total heat removal within 1% of the declared 4 W input."},{"id":"HEAT01-REFINEMENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Reporting policy","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"}],"text":"Each candidate's coarse-to-refined hot-end temperature-rise change is at most 2% and retains both mesh identities."},{"id":"HEAT01-OUTCOME-40","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"row:baseline_40","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df212051c8ed02c328f"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/context.md","locator":"Engineering objective and shop capability","sha256":"4817f9a8f0dbaa6bb6ccd4ba03af8ba7347d9d1129b7b06c40685e42a0448feb"}],"text":"The 40 mm candidate exceeds the inclusive 45 °C hot-end limit under the declared model."},{"id":"HEAT01-OUTCOME-60","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/01-eink-sign-controller-strap/alternatives.csv","locator":"row:revision_60","sha256":"29d9f7d3b89d687edc7cdf14ded48e4357257a9f27764df21205